  "title": "ISic001537. Funerary inscription of Makaria Euangelis",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"οἴκος\">οἴκος</span>  <span data-text=\"αἰώνος\">αἰώνος</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐν\">ἐν</span> (Χριστ)ῷ <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μακαρία Εὐανγέλις\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μακαρία\">Μακαρία</span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Εὐανγέλις\">Εὐανγέλις</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"πιστὴ\">πιστὴ</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐν\">ἐν</span> (Χριστ)ῷ <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἄ\n                    μεμπτος\">ἄ-<br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>μεμπτος</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη</span>  <span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">κ</span>´ <span data-text=\"μῆ\n                    νας \">μῆ-<br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>νας </span>θ´ <span data-text=\"ἡμέρας\">ἡμέρας</span>  <span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ιζ</span>´. <span data-text=\"παρ\n                    θένος\">παρ-<br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>θένος</span>  <span data-text=\"ἁγνοτάτη\">ἁγνοτάτη</span>  <span data-text=\"νυνφευ\n                    θεῖσα\">νυνφευ-<br id=\"al7-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>[θεῖσα]</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐν\">[ἐν]</span>  <span data-text=\"γαμῷ\">[γα]μῷ</span>  <span data-text=\"νομίμῳ\">νομίμῳ</span>  <br id=\"al8-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">[ἐτελεύτη]σεν</span>  <span data-text=\"πρὸ\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">π͡ρ</span>ὸ</span> α´ <span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">καλανδῶν</span>  <br id=\"al9-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]εἰς <span data-text=\"εἰρήνην\">εἰρήνην</span>  <span data-text=\"ἡ\">ἡ</span>  <span data-text=\"κοί\n                    μησίς\">κοί-<br id=\"al10-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span>[μησίς]</span>  <span data-text=\"σου\">[σου]</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"οἴκος\">ΟΙΚΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"αἰώνος\">ΑΙΩΝΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\">ΕΝ</span>☧Ω<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Μακαρία Εὐανγέλις\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Μακαρία\">ΜΑΚΑΡΙΑ</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Εὐανγέλις\">ΕΥΑΝΓΕΛΙΣ</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"πιστὴ\">ΠΙΣΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\">ΕΝ</span>☧Ω<span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἄ\n                    μεμπτος\">Α<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>ΜΕΜΠΤΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ΕΤΗ</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Κ</span><span data-text=\"μῆ\n                    νας \">ΜΗ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΝΑΣ</span>Θ<span data-text=\"ἡμέρας\">ΗΜΕΡΑΣ</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ΙΖ</span><span data-text=\"παρ\n                    θένος\">ΠΑΡ<br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>ΘΕΝΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἁγνοτάτη\">ΑΓΝΟΤΑΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"νυνφευ\n                    θεῖσα\">ΝΥΝΦΕΥ<br id=\"al7-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7</span>[.....</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\">..</span><span data-text=\"γαμῷ\">..]ΜΩ</span><span data-text=\"νομίμῳ\">ΝΟΜΙΜΩ</span><br id=\"al8-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">[........]ΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\"><span class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Π͡Ρ</span>Ο</span>Α<span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\">ΚΑΛΑΝΔΩΝ</span><br id=\"al9-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΕΙΣ<span data-text=\"εἰρήνην\">ΕΙΡΗΝΗΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἡ\">Η</span><span data-text=\"κοί\n                    μησίς\">ΚΟΙ<br id=\"al10-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span>[.....</span><span data-text=\"σου\">...]</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text of Agnello checked against inventory transcription</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"lines 6-7\">lines.6-7: <span>νυνφευ|[θεῖσα ἐν γα]μῷ Agnello</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 8\">line.8: <span>[ἐτελεύτη]σεν Orsi, Agnello</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"lines 9-10\">lines.9-10: <span>ἡ κοί|[μησίς σου Agnello</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>The dwelling place of eternity in Christ. Makaria Euangelis, faithful in Christ, lived blamelessly for 20 years, 9 months, and 17 days. A most pure virgin, though she had been given in lawful marriage, she died one day before the Kalends of [...]. May your sleep be in peace.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription opens with a reference to the tomb as the <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">οἶκος αἰῶνος ἐν (Χριστ)ῷ</span> (cf. Orsi 1893, 390) and the name the deceased, Makaria Euangelis: <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Μακαρία</span> in this case is a personal name and not an epithet (for the attestations of <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Μακαρία</span> in Sicily, see LGPN IIIA 286; <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Εὐαγγέλις</span> is not attested in the feminine form). The deceased, who died at a young age, had been given in marriage, according to Agnello's restoration of ll. 6–7, <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἁγνοτάτη νυνφευ|[θεῖσα ἐν γα]μῷ νομίμῳ</span>, in contrast to Orsi, who interpreted the passage as a reference to the Virgin Mary, restoring <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Νυμφυ|[τόκος</span>. Following the formula recording the day of death, the inscription concludes with the consolatory expression <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">εἰς εἰρήνην ἡ κοί|[μησίς σου</span> in ll. 9–10. This formula is frequently attested in Jewish inscriptions from Magna Graecia, including examples with the second-person singular possessive pronoun (cf. e.g., JIWE I 16, 46; II 39, 205), and is comparable to other expressions found in Sicilian inscriptions, such as <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">εἰς αἰῶνα μετὰ τῶν ἁγίων</span> (IG XIV 139, Syracuse) and <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">εἰς μνημόσυνον αἰώνων</span> (IG XIV 179, Syracuse). This expression, together with the reference to the Law at l. 7 (<span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">νομίμῳ</span>), identifies the inscription as Jewish rather than Christian, despite its repeated Christian professions (cf. Ferrua 1938, 73–74; Agnello 1953, 82).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Orsi NSA 1893 389-390 no.5 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392</a></li><li> Agnello 1953 no.57 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a></li></ul>  <ul><li> Ferrua 1938 73-74 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002004\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002004</a></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
