      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text of Agnello checked against inventory transcription</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"lines 6-7\">lines.6-7: <span>νυνφευ|[θεῖσα ἐν γα]μῷ Agnello</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 8\">line.8: <span>[ἐτελεύτη]σεν Orsi, Agnello</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"lines 9-10\">lines.9-10: <span>ἡ κοί|[μησίς σου Agnello</span></span></li></ul>"
